---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | CoverData" lang="en">
  <main class="container legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
      In accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and Spanish Organic Law 3/2018,
      users are informed about the processing of their personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      Controller: Cover Data S.L.<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:info@cover-data.com">info@cover-data.com</a><br />
      Country: Spain
    </p>

    <h2>2. Purpose of processing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to enquiries and information requests.</li>
      <li>Manage professional communications.</li>
      <li>Provide contracted services.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      Processing is based on user consent, contractual necessity,
      and legal obligations.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      Data will be retained while a relationship exists or as required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>5. User rights</h2>
    <p>
      Users may exercise their rights by emailing
      <a href="mailto:info@cover-data.com">info@cover-data.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Security</h2>
    <p>
      CoverData applies appropriate technical and organisational measures
      to ensure data security.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal h1 { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 22px; font-size: 20px; }
  .legal p, .legal li { line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; color: #334155; }
  .legal ul { margin-left: 18px; }
</style>

